      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GAUNT.\nGod’s is the quarrel; for God’s substitute,\nHis deputy anointed in His sight,\nHath caused his death, the which if wrongfully,\nLet heaven revenge, for I may never lift\nAn angry arm against His minister.",
